---
import SiteLayout from '@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | FashionPlusBeauty"
  description="Read the FashionPlusBeauty privacy policy and learn how this static editorial website is designed to handle information."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="static-page-hero" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Your information, treated thoughtfully</p>
    <h1 id="privacy-title">Privacy policy.</h1>
    <p>A plain-language starting point for how FashionPlusBeauty handles information.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="prose-page">
    <div class="legal-notice"><strong>Important launch checklist:</strong> this is a starter policy, not legal advice. Update it before launch to reflect your domain, audience, ad network, email platform, analytics, cookies, and the laws that apply to your readers.</div>
    <p><strong>Last updated: October 12, 2026.</strong></p>
    <h2>About this site</h2>
    <p>FashionPlusBeauty is an editorial website about fashion, beauty and lifestyle. The initial site is statically generated. It does not currently provide user accounts, comments, or a connected newsletter service. The newsletter form shown on the site is a visual preview and does not submit or store an email address.</p>
    <h2>Information you choose to share</h2>
    <p>If you contact us by email, we receive the information you include in your message and use it to reply. Do not send sensitive personal information through a general inquiry email.</p>
    <h2>Cookies, advertising and analytics</h2>
    <p>The static version does not intentionally set first-party analytics cookies. If advertising, analytics, affiliate tools or a newsletter provider are connected, those services may collect device, usage or preference information using cookies or similar technologies. Their practices are governed by their own notices. This policy must be revised before enabling those services, including information about consent choices where required.</p>
    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>Stories may link to third-party websites. We do not control their content, security or privacy practices. Review the privacy notice of any site you visit.</p>
    <h2>Your choices and questions</h2>
    <p>Depending on where you live, you may have rights to request access, correction or deletion of personal information, or to object to certain processing. Contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@fashionplusbeauty.com">hello@fashionplusbeauty.com</a> to ask a question. Replace this address with a monitored inbox before publication.</p>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
